{"seq":1,"slug":"api-platform-slo-observability","title":"API 平台 SLO 与可观测性：SLI 定义、错误预算与分布式追踪延迟归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/headless-composable-commerce-api-platform/api-platform-operations/api-platform-slo-observability","wordCount":2919,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"api-平台-slo-与可观测性-sli-定义-错误预算与分布式追踪延迟归因\">API 平台 SLO 与可观测性：SLI 定义、错误预算与分布式追踪延迟归因</h1><p>无头电商把「店面」从后端里拆出去之后，后端只剩一样东西可交付：API 接口。前端、移动端、门店 POS、第三方 ERP 都通过同一组 Catalog、Cart、Checkout、Pricing 接口取数，于是平台团队对外的承诺不再是「页面能打开」，而是「这些接口在什么成功率与延迟下可用」。SLO 就是把这条承诺写成可测的数学对象；可观测性则是证明它当场成立或失败的证据链。跨境电商让这件事更难：一次结算请求可能横跨三个地域的边缘节点、两套 BFF 和四个商务 PBC，任一环节的尾延迟都可能吃掉整个体验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把接口承诺写成可测量\">核心概念：把接口承诺写成可测量</h2><p>三个词必须分清。<strong>SLI（Service Level Indicator）</strong> 是从真实流量算出来的比值，如「过去 5 分钟结算接口返回 2xx/3xx 的请求占比」。<strong>SLO（Service Level Objective）</strong> 是给这个比值定的目标，如「28 天窗口内 99.9%」。<strong>SLA</strong> 是带赔付条款的法律合同，通常远松于 SLO——SLO 是内部工程目标，用来在用户感知之前触发行动（Google SRE Workbook 第 2 章，sre.google/workbook/implementing-slos）。</p>\n<p>误差预算（error budget）把 SLO 反着写。若目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SLO</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span>，则允许的坏事件比例是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-SLO</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个有效事件中允许失败</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = (1 - SLO)\\cdot N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>99.9% 的 SLO 在 28 天窗口里意味着约 40 分钟的完全不可用等价额度。误差预算把「可靠性」和「迭代速度」放进同一个账户：预算没花完，团队可以激进发布；花完了，错误预算政策触发冻结。这就是 SLO 真正的作用——它不是仪表盘装饰，而是一条<strong>预先约定好的决策规则</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  U[客户端 店面 移动端 POS] --&gt; E[边缘节点 CDN&lt;br/&gt;缓存 鉴权 分流]&#10;  E --&gt; G[API 网关&lt;br/&gt;限流 路由 认证]&#10;  G --&gt; B[BFF 编排层&lt;br/&gt;并行扇出 聚合裁剪]&#10;  B --&gt; C[Catalog 服务]&#10;  B --&gt; P[Pricing 服务]&#10;  B --&gt; I[Inventory 服务]&#10;  B --&gt; X[Checkout 服务]&#10;  C --&gt; T[(可观测性后端&lt;br/&gt;指标 追踪 日志)]&#10;  P --&gt; T&#10;  I --&gt; T&#10;  X --&gt; T&#10;  B --&gt; T&#10;  G --&gt; T\">graph TD\n  U[客户端 店面 移动端 POS] --&gt; E[边缘节点 CDN&lt;br/&gt;缓存 鉴权 分流]\n  E --&gt; G[API 网关&lt;br/&gt;限流 路由 认证]\n  G --&gt; B[BFF 编排层&lt;br/&gt;并行扇出 聚合裁剪]\n  B --&gt; C[Catalog 服务]\n  B --&gt; P[Pricing 服务]\n  B --&gt; I[Inventory 服务]\n  B --&gt; X[Checkout 服务]\n  C --&gt; T[(可观测性后端&lt;br/&gt;指标 追踪 日志)]\n  P --&gt; T\n  I --&gt; T\n  X --&gt; T\n  B --&gt; T\n  G --&gt; T</pre><p>测量点决定 SLI 的含义。网关测到的成功率包含下游一切故障，是<strong>用户视角 SLI</strong>；单个 PBC 内部测到的是<strong>组件视角 SLI</strong>。两者都要有，但对外承诺只能基于前者——否则 Catalog 自认 99.99%，用户却因 BFF 串行超时只看到 95%。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SLI 类型</th>\n<th>计算式</th>\n<th>适用接口</th>\n<th>坏事件定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可用性</td>\n<td>好请求 / 有效请求</td>\n<td>全部读写接口</td>\n<td>5xx、连接超时、被截断响应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>快请求 / 有效请求</td>\n<td>目录、价格、搜索</td>\n<td>端到端耗时 &gt; 阈值（如 p99 目标 300ms）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正确性</td>\n<td>结果正确请求 / 总请求</td>\n<td>结算、库存扣减</td>\n<td>返回 200 但数据错（需业务校验）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新鲜度</td>\n<td>新鲜数据请求 / 总请求</td>\n<td>库存、价格</td>\n<td>数据年龄 &gt; 允许窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>吞吐覆盖</td>\n<td>被限流前接受请求 / 到达请求</td>\n<td>网关级</td>\n<td>429 且非客户端超额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>有效请求要过滤掉不构成平台责任的事件：客户端 4xx 参数错误直接从分母剔除（Google SRE 记为「无效」），健康检查与预检 OPTIONS 同样剔除。但 429 要小心——若限流源于平台自身容量不足，它就是坏事件，不能因「我们主动拒绝」而洗白。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sli-定义-按接口面分层与聚合陷阱\">SLI 定义：按接口面分层与聚合陷阱</h2><p>一个商务 API 平台有几十个接口，逐个定义 SLO 不现实，按「接口面」分组才对。分组依据是<strong>调用方期待</strong>而非实现：店面首屏依赖的目录/价格读接口为一组，购物车与结算的写接口为另一组（写更贵、更不可重试），后台批量接口为第三组。写接口的 SLO 通常比读更松，但「数据正确」更严——库存扣减绝不能重复。\n延迟 SLI 用<strong>阈值占比</strong>而非平均值：占比形式与 SLO 语义天然对齐，平均值则会被少量慢请求掩盖。若端到端 p99 目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SLI_{lat} = \\frac{\\#\\{r : d_r \\le T\\}}{\\#\\{r\\}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条比值有几个已知陷阱。<strong>其一，均值与单一分位数不足以描述分布</strong>——跨境场景下延迟常呈双峰（命中边缘 vs 回源跨洋），p99 看不见形状，需要直方图热力图。<strong>其二，聚合不能平均比值</strong>：三个接口各 99%、99%、90%，合并后不是 96%，必须把好事件数与总事件数分别相加再相除，否则高频健康的接口会掩盖低频致命的接口。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mfrac><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SLI_{agg} = \\frac{\\sum_i G_i}{\\sum_i N_i} \\neq \\frac{1}{k}\\sum_i \\frac{G_i}{N_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4254em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.638em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>其三，SLO 要按地域与渠道加权</strong>。某国市场占 60% 流量，其本地支付网关的抖动会主导全局 SLI；只按全局算一个数，本地故障被稀释到看不见。主流做法是全球 SLO 之下再挂一层地域 SLO，全局触发慢速告警、地域触发快速告警。接口面契约的版本演进会影响 SLI 定义——新增字段不算破坏，改变错误码语义则可能让「好请求」判定失效，边界见 <code>../2_commerce-api-surface-catalog/2_api-contract-versioning-evolution.md</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"错误预算-燃尽率与多窗口告警\">错误预算、燃尽率与多窗口告警</h2><p>误差预算本身是滞后指标：等到 28 天窗口结束才发现超支，用户已经难受了三周。工程上真正触发行动的是<strong>燃尽率（burn rate）</strong>，即当前错误率相对于预算消耗速度的倍数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BR = \\frac{E}{1 - SLO}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 是当前错误比例。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BR=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示按当前速度恰好用完整个窗口预算；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BR=14.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14.4</span></span></span></span></span> 表示按此速度 2 天就会烧光 28 天的额度。预算耗尽时间可反解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mi>E</mi></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{exhaust} = \\frac{1-SLO}{E}\\cdot W = \\frac{W}{BR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把燃尽率配多个时间窗口，就得到 Google SRE Workbook 第 5 章推荐的多窗口多燃尽率告警。核心洞见是：<strong>短窗口捕捉突发、长窗口抑制误报</strong>，两者同时满足才报警。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>严重度</th>\n<th>长窗口</th>\n<th>短窗口</th>\n<th>燃尽率阈值</th>\n<th>预算消耗</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>页面（page）</td>\n<td>1 小时</td>\n<td>5 分钟</td>\n<td>14.4</td>\n<td>2%</td>\n<td>两天内烧光，立即拉人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>页面</td>\n<td>6 小时</td>\n<td>30 分钟</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td>四天内烧光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工单（ticket）</td>\n<td>3 天</td>\n<td>6 小时</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>窗口内将超支</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套设计让告警与「用户实际受了多久的苦」挂钩，而非与瞬时尖峰挂钩：一次 30 秒抖动在 1 小时窗口只消耗 0.4% 预算，不该半夜叫醒人；而持续 5 分钟的错误率飙升在短窗口就超过 14.4 倍，必须立即响应。告警之外还要有<strong>错误预算政策</strong>：预算消耗超 50% 冻结非关键发布，超 100% 只允许修复类变更。政策不写进发布流程，预算就只是一个数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分布式追踪-上下文传播与采样策略\">分布式追踪：上下文传播与采样策略</h2><p>指标能告诉你「99% 的请求在 300ms 内」，但答不出「那 1% 慢在哪一跳」。分布式追踪把一次请求经过的每一跳记录成带父子关系的 span，用单一 trace_id 串起来。跨服务传播靠 W3C Trace Context 标准（w3c.github.io/trace-context）：HTTP 头 <code>traceparent</code> 携带 trace_id、span_id、采样标志，<code>tracestate</code> 携带厂商特定附加状态。OpenTelemetry 的 trace context 传播器即实现该标准（opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/context-propagation）。跨境链路上任何一跳丢了它，整条链路就断成两段——sidecar、网关重写、消息队列 header 透传都要逐一验证。</p>\n<p>采样是追踪能否上生产的关键。<strong>头部采样</strong>在入口按固定概率决定，实现简单，但可能整体丢弃稀少而重要的错误 trace。<strong>尾部采样</strong>由 Collector 缓存完整 trace、等 span 到齐后按规则决策，能保证「含错误的 trace、超时的 trace」100% 保留，代价是需按 trace_id 分组缓冲并承担内存压力（OpenTelemetry Collector tail sampling processor，opentelemetry.io/docs/collector）。对电商平台，策略通常写成：错误全留、慢于 p99 的全留、其余按 1% 抽样。</p>\n<p>链路数据量巨大，全量存储不经济，于是有两级降本手段：<strong>span metrics 连接器</strong>把 span 实时聚合成按服务/操作/状态码的 RED 指标（Request rate、Error、Duration），只存指标不存 span；<strong>exemplar（样本指针）</strong> 让指标的某个直方图桶直接挂一个 trace_id，从看板点一下就能跳进那条慢请求的瀑布图。两者配合，等于用指标的价格买到追踪的定位能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟归因-临界路径与-bff-扇出\">延迟归因：临界路径与 BFF 扇出</h2><p>拿到瀑布图后，最容易犯的错是把各子 span 耗时相加，得到远超端到端延迟的数。并行扇出时，父 span 耗时约等于子 span 的<strong>最大值</strong>而非和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{parent} \\approx \\max_i (d_i) + d_{self}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4777em;vertical-align:-0.7277em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7277em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{self}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是父 span 的<strong>独占时间（self time）</strong>——父自身做序列化、渲染、网络等待而无子 span 覆盖的时间。延迟归因的本质是沿 span 树自顶向下找出<strong>临界路径</strong>：从根到叶耗时最长的那条链，其余并行分支即使各自很慢，只要不在临界路径上就不贡献端到端延迟。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  R[结算请求端到端 820ms] --&gt; G[网关鉴权限流 25ms]&#10;  R --&gt; B[BFF 编排 self 40ms]&#10;  B --&gt; C[Catalog 读 120ms]&#10;  B --&gt; P[Pricing 含税换算 260ms]&#10;  B --&gt; I[Inventory 预占 90ms]&#10;  B --&gt; X[Checkout 支付预授权 700ms]&#10;  X --&gt; PG[本地支付网关 640ms]&#10;  C --&gt; T[(响应组装)]&#10;  P --&gt; T&#10;  I --&gt; T&#10;  X --&gt; T\">graph TD\n  R[结算请求端到端 820ms] --&gt; G[网关鉴权限流 25ms]\n  R --&gt; B[BFF 编排 self 40ms]\n  B --&gt; C[Catalog 读 120ms]\n  B --&gt; P[Pricing 含税换算 260ms]\n  B --&gt; I[Inventory 预占 90ms]\n  B --&gt; X[Checkout 支付预授权 700ms]\n  X --&gt; PG[本地支付网关 640ms]\n  C --&gt; T[(响应组装)]\n  P --&gt; T\n  I --&gt; T\n  X --&gt; T</pre><p>这张图里四条并行分支中 Checkout 是临界路径（700ms 含其子 640ms），端到端 820ms 主要由它决定。Pricing 的 260ms 看着刺眼，但改到 100ms 对端到端几乎无感——这就是「按耗时排序再优化最慢接口」为何是常见误判，正确做法是按<strong>临界路径贡献</strong>排序。归因到跨境时还要把网络 RTT 单独建模：跨洋 RTT 基线约 150–250ms，若某 PBC 的独占时间里包含两次跨洋往返，真正的瓶颈是拓扑而非代码，解法是就近部署或把该服务复制到边缘属地。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>延迟预算分配</th>\n<th>目标（端到端 p99 ≤ 800ms）</th>\n<th>归因证据</th>\n<th>常见瓶颈</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>边缘 + 网关</td>\n<td>≤ 50ms</td>\n<td>网关 span 独占时间</td>\n<td>TLS 握手、鉴权重查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BFF 编排 self</td>\n<td>≤ 60ms</td>\n<td>父 span self time</td>\n<td>串行扇出、N+1 聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目录/价格读</td>\n<td>≤ 200ms</td>\n<td>子 span 时长</td>\n<td>缓存未命中、跨区回源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存预占</td>\n<td>≤ 150ms</td>\n<td>子 span + 锁等待</td>\n<td>行锁争用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付预授权</td>\n<td>≤ 400ms</td>\n<td>下游网关 span</td>\n<td>第三方网关、合规校验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>落地时容易忽略的是<strong>从指标下钻到 trace 的闭环</strong>。Prometheus 直方图只给分位数，答不出是哪些请求慢；把 exemplar 存进直方图、把 span metrics 连接器产出的 RED 指标接进同一看板，才能做到「看板发现 p99 抬升 → 点 exemplar 跳到 trace → 瀑布图定位临界路径 → 定向修复」。网关与 BFF 的职责切分决定了你能在哪一层测到干净的 SLI，见 <code>../2_commerce-api-surface-catalog/3_api-gateway-federation-bff-composition.md</code>；更靠上层的编排如何组织扇出，见 <code>../1_composable-architecture-pattern/3_composable-orchestration-integration-patterns.md</code>。店面首屏是否复用同一套指标口径取决于渲染层选型，取舍见 <code>../3_storefront-rendering-experience/1_headless-storefront-rendering-model.md</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>SLI 是比值，SLO 是目标，SLA 是合同</strong>；误差预算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=(1-SLO)\\cdot N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 把可靠性变成可花销的账户。</li>\n<li>有效请求要过滤客户端 4xx 与健康检查，但平台自身导致的 429 必须计为坏事件。</li>\n<li>聚合 SLI 必须<strong>先加分子分母再相除</strong>，绝不能平均各接口的比值；跨境平台还需按地域挂细分 SLO。</li>\n<li>告警用<strong>多窗口多燃尽率</strong>：短窗捕突发、长窗抑误报，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BR=14.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14.4</span></span></span></span></span> 配 1 小时窗口是常见的页面级阈值。</li>\n<li>追踪靠 W3C Trace Context 传播；<strong>尾部采样</strong>保证错误与慢请求 100% 保留，span metrics + exemplar 用指标价格买到定位能力。</li>\n<li>延迟归因看<strong>临界路径</strong>而非各 span 之和：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{parent}\\approx\\max_i d_i + d_{self}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，非临界路径的慢接口优化收益极小。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"API 平台 SLO 与可观测性：SLI 定义、错误预算与分布式追踪延迟归因","id":"api-平台-slo-与可观测性-sli-定义-错误预算与分布式追踪延迟归因"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把接口承诺写成可测量","id":"核心概念-把接口承诺写成可测量"},{"level":2,"text":"SLI 定义：按接口面分层与聚合陷阱","id":"sli-定义-按接口面分层与聚合陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"错误预算、燃尽率与多窗口告警","id":"错误预算-燃尽率与多窗口告警"},{"level":2,"text":"分布式追踪：上下文传播与采样策略","id":"分布式追踪-上下文传播与采样策略"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟归因：临界路径与 BFF 扇出","id":"延迟归因-临界路径与-bff-扇出"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"店面性能与 Core Web Vitals 工程：TTFB/LCP/INP 预算、缓存分层与降级策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/headless-composable-commerce-api-platform/storefront-rendering-experience/storefront-performance-core-web-vitals"},"next":{"title":"API 安全、多租户隔离与合规：OAuth2/scope 授权、租户边界与 PCI/GDPR 约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/headless-composable-commerce-api-platform/api-platform-operations/api-security-tenant-isolation-compliance"}}